sequenceDiagram
    accTitle: M9 sponsor enrollment sequence
    accDescr: One owner instruction reaches an enrolled sponsor, which contacts a new host over an already-trusted channel, prepares it, verifies a target-generated key, and publishes a roster edit on main at origin. Newcomer requests stay inert and ephemeral leaves stay channel-bound.
    participant O as Owner
    participant S as Sponsor host
    participant N as New host
    O->>S: 1 · Ask fleet-add host-a
    S->>N: 2 · Contact over trusted SSH lane
    S->>N: 3 · Prepare prerequisites and fleet-init
    N->>N: 4 · Key mint on target
    N-->>S: 5 · Prove public key and possession proof
    S->>N: 6 · Return remote URL and store identity as data
    S->>S: 7 · Publish roster line and push
    Note over N: 8 · Arrive only when commit is on main@origin; durable policy soaks 24h
    Note over O,N: Newcomer request stays inert; ephemeral leaf stays channel-bound
